{"server":"cn","storyId":"act12d0_level_act12d0_02_end","groupId":"act12d0","stageId":"act12d0_02","title":"粗细有别","storyCode":"RI-2","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act12d0/level_act12d0_02_end.txt","sourceHash":"b40e38d8d07637b99b9d77a793a5a69a0ca8d6b554744ba750fac65d4b8dc82a","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_jungleentrance"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿达克利斯人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"噫，这、这招死亡大风车......还有这个发夹......你、你难道是嘉维尔！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"正是我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿达克利斯人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"可恶，遇到你算我们倒霉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿达克利斯人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，就算你是嘉维尔，也别想动摇我们对粗尾巴的信仰！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"既然这么嚣张就别逃啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，我们走吧，下次碰到了再收拾他们。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_jungleentrance"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"嘉维尔，你怎么放过他们了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"以前的你，遇到这种事肯定会把他们全追上打晕才解气的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，以前的我会这样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，我现在觉得他们还挺可爱的，对吧，博士。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"虽然听不懂，不过确实。","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然由我来说可能比较奇怪，不过这里都是些头脑简单的家伙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，在外面动不动就要费脑子，有时候我也会怀念这里。"}]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，博士，你该不会也觉得粗尾巴比较好吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"我可不同意啊！"}]},{"label":"暴揍他们的你比较不可爱。","value":"3","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"哈！虽然我觉得他们可爱，但并不妨碍我揍他们啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"这叫怎么说来着，对了，一码归一码！"}]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"嘉维尔......真的和以前不一样了呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？等等，特米米，你这丫头。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"诶？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"几年不见，你的尾巴又变粗了啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"诶诶诶！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"你该不会也是粗尾巴那一边的吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"没有没有，我也不是自己想它才变这么粗的呀！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"呜呜，我也想要嘉维尔一样的细尾巴......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"这样啊，啧啧，真是个可怜的孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，刚才战斗的时候看了看，你的源石技艺变得挺厉害了啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"真、真的吗？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，来我们罗德岛做个干员应该都没问题了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"干......员？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"干员就是呃，反正就是干活的，比如我就是医疗干员。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"我记得我走的时候你还在巫医那里学习吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯！为了嘉维尔能够回来，我每天都在磨练自己！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"为了我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......唔，我是说，为了嘉维尔回来的时候能够帮上忙！就像刚才那样！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，那你确实帮上了忙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"诶嘿嘿......被嘉维尔夸奖了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，总而言之，继续前进吧，我记得神庙就在前面不远了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_jungleentrance"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿达克利斯人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"森蚺绝对是大酋长啊，他们部族这么厉害。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿达克利斯人B","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，而且她自己也很强，以前不都说除了嘉维尔，就是森蚺了，现在嘉维尔不在......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿达克利斯人C","speakerId":"avg_npc_072","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，看那边！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿达克利斯人B","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"那个难道是，嘉维尔？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿达克利斯人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，嘉维尔，你终于回来了啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"噢，好久不见啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_jungleentrance"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿达克利斯人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，你腰上这根羽毛这么好看，哪里来的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿达克利斯人B","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"我用武器去跟依娜姆大姐换的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿达克利斯人C","speakerId":"avg_npc_072","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，你们部族真好，依娜姆大姐什么都搞得到，我也想去你们部族啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿达克利斯人B","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"不行，依娜姆大姐最讨厌人多了，不过你们要是有什么想要的，可以问我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿达克利斯人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"好啊！......喂，看那边。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿达克利斯人C","speakerId":"avg_npc_072","isRemote":false,"text":"那个，难道是嘉维尔！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿达克利斯人B","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"她居然回来了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿达克利斯人C","speakerId":"avg_npc_072","isRemote":false,"text":"嘉维尔，你原来没死啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"我活得好好的！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_jungleentrance"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿达克利斯人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"哥哥，别逞强了，你都得了石头病了，还是在家好好躺着吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿达克利斯人B","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"别说了，一点小病比起祭典算什么！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿达克利斯人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然是小病，但也是病啊！而且要是让别人看到我哥哥尾巴上长出石头，那多丢人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿达克利斯人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"而且嘉维尔不在，大酋长肯定是祖玛玛！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿达克利斯人B","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"我就是要见证祖玛玛当上酋长的那一刻啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿达克利斯人B","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"可恶，我不该不听祖玛玛的话......嗯？弟弟，看那边！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿达克利斯人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"不是吧，那个人是......嘉维尔？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿达克利斯人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"她难道回来争大酋长了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿达克利斯人B","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"......弟弟，抱歉，这下看来我必须去看祭典了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿达克利斯人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，哥哥，这下确实不看不行了呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"咦，那两个人，好像是森蚺部族的......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_jungleentrance"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿达克利斯人B","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"真的是嘉维尔！你终于回来了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿达克利斯人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"嘉维尔，我一直相信你的啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿达克利斯人C","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，大伙，快看，是嘉维尔！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿达克利斯人们","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘉维尔，嘉维尔，嘉维尔！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"真是群热闹的家伙......我们还是走快点吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，毕竟大家都很喜欢祭典呢，也都很喜欢嘉维尔呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，嘉维尔，看前面那块板子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"我看看，啧，写的什么破字......哦，就是写的“玛维索提亚”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"我们到了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_temple_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"咦，这里怎么会有音乐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"而且这音乐怎么有些耳熟......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，博士，这不是AUS的歌吗！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"确实。","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"是吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然我不太懂，但是听其他人偶尔放也有印象。"}]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，别陶醉进去听啊！"}]},{"label":"是吗？","value":"3","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"罗德岛上也有不少这支乐队的粉丝，应该没错。"}]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，确实是AUS的歌呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎么也知道AUS？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"大约去年的时候，有一群自称AUS的奇怪外乡人来过这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"她们先是在依娜姆的部族那里进行了一次演唱会，这场演唱会过后，很多提亚卡乌都把她们当成“玛维索提亚”的使者来对待了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"哈？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"然后她们就被请求留在这里进行了相当长一段时间的演出，而且演出的地点基本都是在神庙那里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"我也有听过一次，确实是很厉害很好听的音乐呢......而且能感觉到很厉害的法术技巧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"在那之后，许多提亚卡乌就爱上了这种音乐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"然后有一天，她们就又忽然消失了，大家都说她们是回到先祖的怀抱去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"不过我知道她们只是和嘉维尔你一样离开了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"这里播放的音乐应该是有人把她们离开时留下的叫做“音响”的东西搬过来了，她们离开前，好像还留下了许多她们的唱片。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"音响？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，因为是需要法术技巧才能使用的东西，所以只有祭祀和巫医们能够使用它们，平时应该都是放在依娜姆的部族里的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈，这支乐队还真是自由。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"而且她们的音乐确实很刺激，我还没进去就已经有些热血沸腾起来了，我开始喜欢上她们了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧，博士，我们进去一边听音乐，一边享受祭典！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","aliases":["嘉维尔"]},{"speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","aliases":["特米米"]}]}
